      ],
      "en": "If you are willing and obedient, you will eat the good of the land;",
      "ko": "너희가 즐겨 순종하면 땅의 아름다운 소산을 먹을 것이요",
      "source_text_hash": "3eb29bfb8fd18d8f7c537636fdc5b9a10529bc96da02f5c88eabcada1bbb4386",
      "translation_text_hash": "6bd3b44e20c5625aa8edb78638830caba7c3e900186c20af1256db3075f2d6d6",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "너희가 즐겨 순종하면 땅의 아름다운 소산을 먹을 것이요"
