      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "ISA",
          "chapter": 1,
          "verse": 21
        }
      ],
      "en": "How the faithful city has become a prostitute! She was full of justice. Righteousness lodged in her, but now there are murderers.",
      "ko": "신실하던 성읍이 어찌하여 창기가 되었는고 공평이 거기 충만하였고 의리가 그 가운데 거하였었더니 이제는 살인자들 뿐이었도다",
      "source_text_hash": "837566eaa0aa727d14466209506a5dc72063c6c733dcdaf8ef44299a2eb68f78",
      "translation_text_hash": "c164dca1df394c68c35103aa9144abcb6e902d1a995e9bfb12748a85521e71a9",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
