      "en": "Your silver has become dross, your wine mixed with water.",
      "ko": "네 은은 찌끼가 되었고 너의 포도주에는 물이 섞였도다",
      "source_text_hash": "bcd7b08b6da21cae953bf0281bc29834da817673291baf9b782901635bbdfb97",
